{"unit_id":"runyuan-wang__dsh-route-certificate#card-zh","repo":"runyuan-wang/dsh-route-certificate","commit":"22141504a4b559ea6777da49abc5523ebdf6be05","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-route-certificate（DeepSeek Harness 插件）：监听会话终止事件，为每个回合生成独立的 RouteCertificate 回执。插件收集事件前缀与产物信息，调用本机 validator，并将回执存入 Profile。内置策略核对请求、事件顺序和终止封套，给出 pass、fail 或 indeterminate；不改写原始结果，也不判断回答语义。适合需要复核多 Agent 任务交接的用户，要求 Harness rc.7 与 Node.js 22.19.0 以上。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:12-20","index.js:56-62","index.js:76-115","index.js:173-190","policy.js:117-165","cordis.patch.yml:1-21"]}
