{"unit_id":"runyuan-wang__dsh-route-certificate#feature-1","repo":"runyuan-wang/dsh-route-certificate","commit":"22141504a4b559ea6777da49abc5523ebdf6be05","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-route-certificate 的功能「终止事件回执」：会话出现 turn/end 时收集事件前缀，构造请求并调用 validator，随后持久化独立 RouteCertificate 回执。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:76-115","index.js:201-245"]}
