{"unit_id":"runyuan-wang__dsh-route-certificate#feature-3","repo":"runyuan-wang/dsh-route-certificate","commit":"22141504a4b559ea6777da49abc5523ebdf6be05","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-route-certificate 的功能「事件封套核验」：校验请求标识、策略摘要、事件顺序、事件前缀摘要及终止信息是否彼此绑定，并在证书中记录检查结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["policy.js:117-153","policy.js:166-214"]}
{"unit_id":"runyuan-wang__dsh-route-certificate#feature-4","repo":"runyuan-wang/dsh-route-certificate","commit":"22141504a4b559ea6777da49abc5523ebdf6be05","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-route-certificate 的功能「已有会话协调」：插件启动或收到 session/created 时扫描已有会话中的 turn/end 事件，补做观察；session/flush 可等待对应回执任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:144-183"]}
{"unit_id":"runyuan-wang__dsh-route-certificate#caveat-1","repo":"runyuan-wang/dsh-route-certificate","commit":"22141504a4b559ea6777da49abc5523ebdf6be05","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-route-certificate 使用前须知：内置策略只核验终止状态与来源封套，不判断回答正确性、语义质量或任务是否成功；中断或遗漏产物会得到 indeterminate。见 policy.js:3-12。","source":"generated","evidence":["policy.js:3-12","policy.js:155-165"]}
